Subject: [PATCH 0010] sm8550: fullscreen game under QAM + visible Steam menus

Implemented in-tree (external-and-mods/gamescope/src/), not a standalone diff.

steamcompmgr.cpp (0010 core):
- window_is_running_game() — real game windows vs Steam/overlay.
- window_last_done_commit_index() — prefer WSI swapchain for games.
- paint_window_commit / paint_window viewport — game uses pLayer as scaleW.
- configure_request / configure_win / unmap_win — ignore shrink/hide on games.
- GAMESCOPE_FOCUSED_APP_GFX — keep game appid while Steam UI has focus.

0010 QAM visibility (same binary, 838faa77 rebuild required):
- Viewport layers: non-game children get PaintWindowFlag::ViewportOverlayZ (zpos overlay).
- update_viewport_stacking — paint game layers before Steam UI layers.
- overlayMinWidth 0 while a game is focused (detect narrow QAM overlay).

wlserver.cpp:
- GAMESCOPE_SM8550_STEAM_INTERNAL_X11 — nested X output named DSI-1 / Valve Deck
  so Steam DisplayManager does not leave QAM behind the game when config.vdf
  says External+Windowed. Session must export this env (gamescope-session).

Deploy:
  ./scripts/build-gamescope-sm8550.sh
  sudo ./scripts/install-sm8550-qam-gamescope-mounted.sh /run/media/masies/root
  sudo cp odin-overlay/usr/lib/steamos/gamescope-session /run/media/masies/root/usr/lib/steamos/
